  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed two storey rear extension by reason of its size, siting and depth would have an overbearing effect upon the adjoining property No. 79 Macleod Road, through loss of light and outlook, detrimental to the amenities of that adjoining neighbouring occupier, contrary to Local Plan Policy CP30 Development Management Document Policies DMD11 and DMD37.",
    "The proposed two storey side extension, due to its design and relationship to the existing dwelling would result in a visually intrusive and discordant form of development not appearing subordinate to the existing dwelling and thus resulting in the introduction of a bulky, incongruous and discordant form of development detrimental to the character and appearance of the existing dwelling and locality.  This would be contrary to Local Plan Policy CP30, Policies DMD14 and DMD37 of the Development Management Document and Policy 7.4 of the London Plan."
